                                            "So full (with something) as almost to erupt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52824160-8c08-46c8-b3d2-b13a13a8d6cc",
                                                "sense_id": "b900d355-c2a5-376b-91a6-48f216e4016b",
                                                "text": "The newly stocked refrigerator is bursting with fresh vegetables."
